      "markdown": "## Unit 2\n\n## 听力材料\n\n一、听录音,选出你所听到的单词或短语。\n\n1. juice  2. strong  3. long jump\n\n1. What are you going to do on sports day?\n\n2. We have peanuts and sweets.\n\n3. I'm going to swim in the sea.\n\n4. There is a girl on the bike.\n\n5. I'm going to do the high jump.\n\n## 三、 听录音，选出你所听到的句子。\n\n1. He's taking pictures.\n\n2. Do you want some soup?\n\n3. They're going to visit Beijing.\n\n4. There are three chickens.\n\n5. We have sweets and peanuts.\n\n2. Where is the cinema?\n\n1. Can I have some rice?\n\n3. What are they doing?\n\n4. How many pigs are there?\n\n5. Happy New Year.\n\n## 参考答案\n\n三、1. A 2. A 3. B 4. A 5. A\n\n四、1. A 2. B 3. B 4. B 5. A\n\n五、1. C 2. B 3. A 4. A 5. C\n\n4. fast  5. from\n\n八、1. running  2. taking  3. listening\n\n4. want  5. swim\n\n九、1. A  2. B  3. C  4. C  5. A\n\n6. B 7. A 8. C 9. A 10. C\n\n十、25341\n\n十一、1. B 2. C 3. A 4. B\n\n## 期末评估测试卷\n\n5. C 6. B\n\n一、听录音，选出你所听到的单词。\n\n4. We have a big family dinner.\n\n1. There is a cat in the tree.\n\n5. Can I have some sweets, please?\n\n3. It's next to a supermarket.\n\n2. Amy is reading a book.\n\n## 三、 听录音，选出你所听到的句子。\n\n1. Can I have some bread?\n\n2. She's singing a song.\n\n3. She can ride a bike.\n\n4. I'm going to visit my grandpa.\n\n5. The park is near my school.\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_7280_9202_9648_11463.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"14%\" /></div>\n\n\n## 参考答案\n\n一、1. A 2. B 3. C 4. A 5. B\n\n二、32514\n\n6. C 7. B 8. C 9. A 10. C\n\n六、1. C 2. C 3. C 4. A 5. A\n\n八、1. D 2. B 3. E 4. A 5. C",
